that violence and discrimination in any form against women and children constitutes a violation of Human Rights; therefore, violence and discrimination against women and children occurring in West Manggarai Regency must receive optimal services and protection;
that the provision of services for women victims of violence and child protection is one of the authorities of the regency government in accordance with the provisions of Law Number 23 of 2014 concerning Regional Government; therefore, it needs to be regulated by a Regional Regulation;
that based on the considerations as referred to above, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning Services and Protection for Women and Children Victims of Violence;

